OL,3,GNEWSAHow did some houses survive the
OL,4,AStourbridge fire while neighbours lost
OL,5,Aeverything?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany who have seen the damage caused by
OL,8,Fthe devastating fire in Stourbridge
OL,9,Fhave shared similar thoughts to Pritpal
OL,10,FBoyal - why did some homes survive
OL,11,Funscathed while others were gutted?
OL,13,F"I was just amazed at how my
OL,14,Ffather-in-law's house was still
OL,15,Fstanding," he said, mystified. "It was
OL,16,Flike a lottery of whether your house
OL,17,Fwas going to survive or not."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
