OL,3,GNEWSAHow did some houses survive the
OL,4,AStourbridge fire while neighbours lost
OL,5,Aeverything?
OL,6,
OL,7,FNineteen homes across five streets in
OL,8,Fthe town were completely destroyed by
OL,9,Fthe fire last week, with eight
OL,10,Fhouseholds left able to view the shells
OL,11,Fof their former homes.
OL,13,FAerial images of the aftermath showed
OL,14,Fsome houses looking like they escaped
OL,15,Fthe flames while those not far away
OL,16,Ffrom them burnt to the ground.
